stormnic-e1000e
===============

An original Rust implementation, licensed MIT (see LICENSE).

Acknowledgement: hardware facts are learned from Intel's public datasheets
(82574 Family Gigabit Ethernet Controller Datasheet) and, for behaviour only,
iPXE's intel.c and Linux's e1000e driver. No source code is copied from them.

The UEFI glue (driver binding, PCI I/O, SNP), the console/trace and the
check app are taken from the sibling stormnic drivers (stormnic-realtek,
stormnic-virtio, stormnic-ixgbe), the same owner's MIT code.
